{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2021-08-02 13:30:00', 'title': "PG&E'S CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY REPORT SHARES PROGRESS ON SAFETY IMPROVEMENTS, CLEAN ENERGY MILESTONES, AND SERVING CUSTOMERS", 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PG&E TODAY RELEASED ITS ANNUAL CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, WHICH REVIEWS THE COMPANY'S PERFORMANCE THROUGH A “TRIPLE BOTTOM LINE” LENS ON SERVING PEOPLE, THE PLANET, AND CALIFORNIA'S PROSPERITY. “I AM PROUD TO SAY THAT IN 2020, WE CONTINUED TO MOVE FORWARD ON OUR SUSTAINABILITY GOALS, DESPITE THE UNPRECEDENTED CHALLENGES OF THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC AND SOME OF THE MOST EXTREME WEATHER AND WILDFIRE CONDITIONS CALIFORNIA HAS EVER SEEN,” SAID PATTI POPPE, CEO"}